## Observability

OpenTelemetry traces and metrics are wired in from day one. The service name comes from
`OTEL_SERVICE_NAME` (default: the repository slug). Nothing is exported until
`OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` points at an OTLP/HTTP collector; browser projects use
`VITE_OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` (Angular: `environment.ts`) instead.
